ement.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x130","subtitle":"A UNACEM North America Company — three lines of Silka set against the isotype.","name":"Endorsement line"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-incorrect.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x160","subtitle":"Nine prohibitions from the brandbook. Never tilt, recolour, stretch, reorder or letterise the mark.","name":"Incorrect uses"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-isotype.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"The master shape: the U as an impossible figure. Min width 16px.","name":"Isotype"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-logo-horizontal.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Primary lockup. Red on light, white on red, black for print restrictions.","name":"Logo — horizontal"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-logo-vertical.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x190","subtitle":"Used where the horizontal lockup has no room. Min width 38px.","name":"Logo — vertical"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-photography.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x210","subtitle":"Commissioned plant photography. High-key Southwest desert, cool skies, warm ground. No filters, no grain, no duotone.","name":"Photography"},{"path":"ui_kits/brand-site/index.html","group":"Brand Site","viewport":"1280x860","subtitle":"Home, operation detail and people/programs — click through the nav. Extrapolated from the brandbook; see README.","name":"Public site"},{"path":"guidelines/color-brand.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x210","subtitle":"Three values. Nothing else enters the palette.","name":"Brand colours"},{"path":"guidelines/color-contrast.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Red on white is 4.0:1 — below AA for body text. Large display type only.","name":"Contrast traps"},{"path":"guidelines/color-hairlines.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"PROPOSAL — black/white at fixed alpha. The brandbook defines no grey; confirm before shipping.","name":"Hairlines &amp; scrims"},{"path":"guidelines/color-interactive.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Red darkens on hover and press. No opacity fades, no scale.","name":"Interactive states"},{"path":"guidelines/color-proportion.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x120","subtitle":"White 50% / Black 35% / Red 15% by area. A brand rule, not a guideline.","name":"Chromatic proportion"},{"path":"guidelines/color-surfaces.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x160","subtitle":"Drop .unacem-on-dark or .unacem-on-red on a block and every semantic token re-points.","name":"Surface scopes"},{"path":"components/brand/brand.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"Logo, Isotype, Edifications, CoBrandLockup — the marks with their rules built in.","name":"Brand"},{"path":"components/core/core.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x330","subtitle":"Button, Card, Badge, Rule, Eyebrow, StatFigure — flat, square, three colours.","name":"Core"},{"path":"components/feedback/feedback.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"Notice, Dialog, Tooltip — hard scrims, no blur, no shadow.","name":"Feedback"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x330","subtitle":"Input, Textarea, Select, Checkbox, Radio, Switch — 1px keyline, red focus, 44px targets.","name":"Forms"},{"path":"components/navigation/navigation.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x230","subtitle":"Tabs, Breadcrumb, PaginationDots — active state is a red rule, never a pill.","name":"Navigation"},{"path":"ui_kits/internal-comms/index.html","group":"Internal Comms","viewport":"1280x820","subtitle":"A4 internal communication, business card, letterhead, e-mail signature and event totems.","name":"Institutional items"},{"path":"guidelines/motion-tokens.card.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x160","subtitle":"Things rise and are revealed. No bounce, spring, overshoot or sideways slide.","name